  <h1>ADITECH Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p><strong>Last Updated:</strong> November 11, 2026</p>

  <p>
    Welcome to ADITECH. This Privacy Policy explains how
    ADITECH handles information when you use our AI assistant app.
  </p>

  <h2>1. Information We Handle</h2>
  <p>
    Depending on the features you use, information may include
    text prompts, questions, images you choose to upload,
    and basic technical information needed for app operation.
  </p>

  <h2>2. AI Processing</h2>
  <p>
    ADITECH is designed to support AI-powered conversations
    and assistance. When an on-device AI model is used,
    prompts and images are processed on your device.
  </p>
  <p>
    If any app feature uses an external server or third-party
    service, the information required by that feature may
    be transmitted to that service for processing.
  </p>

  <h2>3. Data Collection and Analytics</h2>
  <p>
    The app's actual data collection depends on the services
    and software components included in the installed version.
    Any analytics, crash reporting, or diagnostic services
    used by the app must be disclosed here.
  </p>

  <h2>4. Account Information</h2>
  <p>
    Account and login features are not currently available
    in the version described by this policy. If these features
    are introduced, this policy will be updated.
  </p>

  <h2>5. Data Sharing</h2>
  <p>
    Information may be processed by third-party service
    providers only where required for app functionality,
    analytics, diagnostics, or other disclosed purposes.
    We do not sell personal information.
  </p>

  <h2>6. Data Security</h2>
  <p>
    We take reasonable steps to protect information handled
    by the app. However, no digital system can guarantee
    complete security.
  </p>

  <h2>7. Children's Privacy</h2>
  <p>
    ADITECH is not intended to knowingly collect personal
    information from children without appropriate consent
    where required by applicable law.
  </p>

  <h2>8. Changes to This Policy</h2>
  <p>
    This Privacy Policy may be updated when app features,
    data practices, or legal requirements change.
    The latest version will be published on this page.
  </p>

  <h2>9. Contact Us</h2>
